markdown <<MARKDOWN
A survey asked people about how many close friends they have and how much time they spend socializing. Which best describes the relationship the data shows between these two variables?

| Close Friends | Daily Hours Socializing |
|---|---|
| 2 | 1 |
| 5 | 1 |
| 5 | 2 |
| 3 | 3 | 
| 1 | 3 |
| 4 | 3 |
| 2 | 4 |
MARKDOWN

